<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb aluminium output up 23.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb aluminium output up 23.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 297,200 tonnes of aluminium in January and February, up 23.5 percent from the same two months last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China's aluminium output was 151,600 tonnes in February, the bureau said without giving a year-ago figure.</p>
<p>China's alumina output reached 324,700 tonnes in the first two months of the year, down four percent from the same period last year, it said.</p>
<p>China produced 156,700 tonnes of alumina in February.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
